02:00040448 B0              	  5906:     dc.b    $B0, $74, $94, $B4, $70, $68, $F4, $24
02:00040449 74
02:0004044A 94
02:0004044B B4
02:0004044C 70
02:0004044D 68
02:0004044E F4
02:0004044F 24
